#: code:addons/integration/exceptions.py:0
msgid ""
"Circular dependency detected between product \"%(parent)s (Internal Reference: %(parent_internal_reference)s)\" and next related products:\n"
"%(optional_products)s\n"
"\n"
"Example: Product \"%(parent)s\" is linked as a related product to \"%(optional)s\", and vice versa. This creates an export loop.\n"
"\n"
"To resolve this issue follow these steps:\n"
"1. Open Product Field Mappings and disable \"Related Products\" synchronization.\n"
"2. Export all related products manually to %(platform)s.\n"
"3. Then export \"%(parent)s\" again.\n"
"4. Finally, re-enable \"Related Products\" synchronization and export again.\n"
"\n"
"This ensures all products are linked correctly without recursion."
msgstr ""

